# Player car 1, second sheet. PDF page 14, block M.
# Written like a MAME netlist: chips by location, then each wire as the pins it joins.
# tools/generate_netlist.py names the Verilog wires from the pins: docs/NET_NAMES.md.
chip M6 7432
chip N7 7404
chip N6 74112
chip M5 7420
chip N5 74193
chip N4 74192
chip N3 7402
chip M3 7420
chip N8 7404
chip L4 7420
chip K4 74193
chip L5 74193
chip K5 7421
# MTTA, MTTB, MTA1, MTA0, MTSR are N9 outputs with 6.8 capacitors.
chip P9 7404
chip P8 7432
chip P7 7408
chip M9 74112
chip M8 74112

# Wires: drawing label, then every pin it joins on this sheet. BOARD marks a
# wire that rtl/deathrac_board.v drives or reads. GND/VCC are tied pins, OPEN a
# visibly floating input, NC a drawn output stub that goes nowhere.
net MEGA M6.3 N7.11 M5.13
net 5TCBG M6.1 M6.5
net GGT3 M6.2
net MEGB M6.6 N6.12 N6.11 M5.4 M5.12
net 5GECC M6.4
net 5MEGA N7.10 M5.5
net 2PQ07 N6.13
net M999 N6.10 N6.14 N4.15 N4.1 N4.10 L5.15 M9.10 M8.4 M8.10 BOARD
net MEC1 N6.9 M5.9
net 5MEC1 N6.7 M5.1
net 6MQED M5.6 N5.4
net 1PQ07 M5.2 M5.10 L4.2 L4.10
net 6MQEU M5.8 N5.5
net 5ECDG N5.11 N4.11 K4.11 L5.11
net GND N5.14 N5.15 N5.1 N5.10 N5.9 N4.14 N4.9 K4.14 K4.15 K4.1 K4.10 K4.9 L5.14 L5.1 L5.10 L5.9
net NC N5.3 N5.2 N5.6 N4.13 N4.12 L5.13 L5.12 M9.7 M8.6 M8.7
net MEC5 N5.7 M3.1
net 5MECD N5.13 N4.4
net 5MECU N5.12 N4.5
net MEC6 N4.3 M3.2
net MEC7 N4.2 N3.3
net MEC8 N4.6 N3.2
net MEC9 N4.7 M3.4
net MECE N3.1 M3.5
net 5MECG M3.6 N8.5
net 1MECG N8.6
net MLGA M6.8 N7.13 L4.13
net GGT2 M6.9
net 5TLC9 M6.10 M6.12
net MLGB M6.11 L4.4 L4.12
net 5GLCC M6.13
net 5MLGA N7.12 L4.5
net 6MQLD L4.6 K4.4
net TGLC L4.1 L4.9
net 6MQLU L4.8 K4.5
net MLC1 K4.3
net MLC2 K4.2
net MLC3 K4.6
net MLC4 K4.7
net 5MLCD K4.13 L5.4
net 5MLCU K4.12 L5.5
net MLC5 L5.3 K5.1
net MLC6 L5.2 K5.2
net MLC7 L5.6 K5.4
net MLC8 L5.7 K5.5
net MLCG K5.6
net 5MTTA P9.2 P8.5
net MTTA P9.1 P7.1
net 5MTTB P9.4 P8.1
net MTTB P9.3 P7.5
net MTCR P8.3 P7.2
net MTNR P8.2 P7.3
net MTCC P8.6 P7.4
net MTNL P8.4 P7.6
net 5MTA1 N8.8 M9.12
net MTA1 N8.9 M9.11 BOARD
net 5MTA0 N8.10 M8.2
net MTA0 N8.11 M8.3 BOARD
net 5MTSR N8.12 M8.12
net MTSR N8.13 M8.11 BOARD
net 2ECK2 M9.13 M8.1
net 1MTA1 M9.9
net 1ESGC M9.14 M8.15 M8.14
net 1MTA0 M8.5
net 1ECK0 M8.13
net 1MTSR M8.9
